Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: integrate MT6897 modem module builds
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Enable the implemented MT6897 sources through their Kconfig and
Makefile entries after the component implementations are present.

